# Detection AUTHORED BY the Splunk AI Assistant (SAIA) from a plain-English
# threat description, via Argus. Review before scheduling.
# Prompt: Write an SPL detection over index=omni_guard_security sourcetype=layerzero:transaction that flags any single transaction whose value_eth exceeds 5x the 99th percentile value for that contract_name. Output _time, tx_hash, contract_name, value_eth.

```splunk-spl
index=omni_guard_security sourcetype="layerzero:transaction"
| eval value_eth=tonumber(value_eth)
| eventstats perc99(value_eth) as p99 by contract_name
| where value_eth > 5 * p99
| table _time tx_hash contract_name value_eth
